sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant FE as Frontend (Svelte)
    participant Route as Route Handler
    participant GE as GameEngine
    participant MP as MovePipeline
    participant Val as CheckersValidator
    participant Store as game_store
    participant YAML as checkers.yaml

    Note over FE,YAML: === Player makes a move ===

    FE->>Route: POST /api/v1/checkers/move {move_id, from_row, to_row, ...}
    Route->>Store: get_state("checkers")
    Store-->>Route: GameState

    Route->>GE: submit_move(state, move, expected_version)
    GE->>MP: submit_move(state_dict, move, expected_version)

    MP->>Val: validate_move(state, move)
    Note right of Val: Check turn order, piece ownership,<br/>mandatory jump, must_jump_from
    Val-->>MP: true

    MP->>Val: apply_move(state, move)
    Note right of Val: Move piece, remove captured,<br/>promote king, detect multi-jump
    Val-->>MP: {game_data: {board, must_jump_from?}}

    MP->>Val: check_win(new_state)
    Val-->>MP: None (or winner_id)

    MP-->>GE: {move_id, status, new_state, winner}

    alt Multi-jump required (must_jump_from set)
        GE-->>Route: status="accepted", same player continues
    else Confirm required (phase.confirm_required=true)
        GE-->>Route: status="confirm_required"
    else Normal move
        GE->>GE: advance_phase(state)
        Note left of GE: phase_index++ or<br/>player_index++, reset phases
        GE-->>Route: status="accepted", next player
    end

    Route->>Store: set_state("checkers", state)
    Route->>Route: build_screen_state(state, legal_moves)
    Route->>YAML: Read panels, components, grid config
    Route->>Val: serialize_for_screen(game_data)
    Note right of Val: Convert board array → cells<br/>with piece type/color/king
    Val-->>Route: {cells: [...]}

    Route-->>FE: {status, screen_state: {panels, phase, legal_moves, ...}}

    Note over FE,YAML: === If confirm_required, player confirms ===

    FE->>Route: POST /api/v1/moves/confirm/checkers
    Route->>Store: get_state("checkers")
    Route->>GE: confirm_turn(state)
    GE->>GE: should_show_confirm(state)
    Note left of GE: Read YAML phase config
    GE->>GE: advance_phase(state)
    Note left of GE: Reset phase_index=0,<br/>player_index++, new TurnInfo
    GE-->>Route: {status: "turn_complete"}
    Route->>Store: set_state("checkers", state)
    Route-->>FE: {status, screen_state: {current_player: "player_2", ...}}
